			"start": 948,
			"end": 966
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " `infer` is the same gap once more. Its child is the type PARAMETER, so a constraint",
			"start": 1088,
			"end": 1174
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " rides inside the freeze.",
			"start": 1176,
			"end": 1203
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " prettier-ignore",
			"start": 1232,
			"end": 1250
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A MULTI-LINE frozen operand keeps every one of its lines, hand-alignment and all —",
			"start": 1289,
			"end": 1374
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " the shape the directive is usually written for.",
			"start": 1376,
			"end": 1426
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " prettier-ignore",
			"start": 1445,
			"end": 1463
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A union operand keeps its required parens and declines the whole-operand freeze:",
			"start": 1497,
			"end": 1580
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " the directive binds through the composite's own leading run, so the FIRST MEMBER",
			"start": 1582,
			"end": 1665
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " freezes and the rest normalizes.",
			"start": 1667,
			"end": 1702
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " prettier-ignore",
			"start": 1721,
			"end": 1739
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " An own-line block comment behaves identically — placement keys the freeze, not the",
			"start": 1762,
			"end": 1847
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " spelling.",
			"start": 1849,
			"end": 1861
		},
		{
